{"seq":2,"slug":"winning-asset-reuse-signal","title":"高效素材识别与复用推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-performance-loop/winning-asset-reuse-signal","wordCount":2478,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"高效素材识别与复用推荐\">高效素材识别与复用推荐</h1><p>识别高效素材的意义在于把一次成功的创作变成下次生产的先验。这件事做浅了是&quot;给高转化素材打个标签然后让运营手动复用&quot;，做深了是&quot;从高效素材中提取可迁移的创意特征，并把它注入下一轮的生成参数&quot;。前者收益有限，后者才构成闭环。但做深会撞上两个陷阱：赢家恒赢导致的创意单一化，以及把相关性当成因果性后系统性地放大噪声。这一节给出既有效又不失控的识别与推荐方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-素材级信号与特征级信号\">核心概念：素材级信号与特征级信号</h2><p>复用推荐有两种作用粒度，价值差别很大：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[&quot;素材级指标&lt;br/&gt;performance_score&quot;] --&gt; R1[&quot;素材级复用&lt;br/&gt;直接复用这个版本&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; FE[&quot;特征提取&quot;]&#10;  FE --&gt; R2[&quot;特征级复用&lt;br/&gt;把成功要素注入新生成&quot;]&#10;  R2 --&gt; G[&quot;下一轮生成参数&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; T[&quot;模板/提示词/风格约束&quot;]&#10;  R1 --&gt; C[&quot;快速产出&lt;br/&gt;边际收益递减&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt; N[&quot;新素材&lt;br/&gt;组合而非复制&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt; P\">graph TD\n  P[\"素材级指标&lt;br/&gt;performance_score\"] --&gt; R1[\"素材级复用&lt;br/&gt;直接复用这个版本\"]\n  P --&gt; FE[\"特征提取\"]\n  FE --&gt; R2[\"特征级复用&lt;br/&gt;把成功要素注入新生成\"]\n  R2 --&gt; G[\"下一轮生成参数\"]\n  G --&gt; T[\"模板/提示词/风格约束\"]\n  R1 --&gt; C[\"快速产出&lt;br/&gt;边际收益递减\"]\n  T --&gt; N[\"新素材&lt;br/&gt;组合而非复制\"]\n  N --&gt; P</pre><p>素材级复用的边际收益是递减的：同一个素材反复投放，用户会疲劳，点击率与转化率随时间下降。特征级复用则能持续产生新素材，只要提取的特征是真实的而不是噪声。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可从素材中提取的特征维度\">可从素材中提取的特征维度</h3><p>特征必须是<strong>可枚举、可复现、可注入生成参数</strong>的。做不到这三点的&quot;特征&quot;只是描述，无法驱动生产。以下几类满足条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征族</th>\n<th>具体取值示例</th>\n<th>提取方式</th>\n<th>注入生成的方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>版式</td>\n<td>主体居中 / 左文右图 / 上下分区</td>\n<td>版面分析或模板 ID</td>\n<td>选择版式模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色调</td>\n<td>高饱和 / 低饱和 / 暖调 / 冷调</td>\n<td>图像主色聚类 + 品牌色差</td>\n<td>调色板参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文案句式</td>\n<td>疑问句 / 数字清单 / 对比句 / 祈使句</td>\n<td>文本分类</td>\n<td>提示词模板槽位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖点组合</td>\n<td>免运费 + 限时 / 质保 + 低价</td>\n<td>标签共现</td>\n<td>卖点组合白名单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体类型</td>\n<td>单人 / 多人 / 产品特写 / 场景</td>\n<td>目标检测</td>\n<td>生成时的主体约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文字密度</td>\n<td>无字 / 少量 / 密集</td>\n<td>文字区域面积比</td>\n<td>文案长度预算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些特征都落在素材库已有的标签 facet 上或可从素材直接计算，因此不需要新建设施——第 1 章的 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/creative-asset-library-tag\">素材库模型与多维标签</a> 里的 <code>visual_style</code>、<code>selling_point</code>、<code>placement</code> 就是这些特征的存储位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"识别-从指标到可复用的结论\">识别：从指标到可复用的结论</h2><h3 id=\"显著性判断\">显著性判断</h3><p>一个素材的 <code>lift_vs_bucket</code> 大于 1 不等于它真的更好——可能只是随机波动。判断显著性要用素材自己作为对照，即与同桶的分布比较而不是与固定阈值比较。</p>\n<p>对转化率这类比率指标，可以用二项分布的近似区间判断观察到的提升是否超出噪声范围：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CI</mtext><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>±</mo><mn>1.96</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CI}_{95\\%} \\approx \\hat{p} \\pm 1.96\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9024em;vertical-align:-0.2191em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CI</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95%</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2191em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是观察到的转化率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是曝光量。只有当素材的转换率下界高于同桶中位数时，才认为提升是可信的。这个简单判据的价值在于它自动处理了数据量差异——曝光少的素材需要大得多的提升才能通过。</p>\n<h3 id=\"特征级的聚合\">特征级的聚合</h3><p>单个素材显著不代表特征有效，因为素材是特征的一个组合。要判断&quot;右文左图&quot;这个版式是否真的好，需要看<strong>所有</strong>使用该版式的素材在控制其他特征后的表现，而不是看某一个用了该版式的爆款。</p>\n<p>这里可以借用表征学习领域已经被验证的结论：CLIP 通过在四亿对互联网图文上做对比预训练，学到的是对齐的图像与文本表征，因此可以仅给定自然语言描述就对新的视觉概念做零样本判断，而无需针对该任务重新训练 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00020\">CLIP: Learning Transferable Visual Models</a>。把素材与它的特征标签嵌入到同一个表征空间后，特征的边际效应就可以在这个空间里度量，而不必只依赖类别标签的交叉计数。</p>\n<p>做法是把素材级指标下推到特征级，用回归或分层聚合估计每个特征的边际效应。工程上一个够用的近似是<strong>配对比较</strong>：在同一市场、同一渠道、同一周的素材中，比较具备某特征与不具备该特征的素材的指标差异，对每个（特征，市场，渠道）计算一个提升倍数与样本量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE feature_lift (&#10;  feature_family text NOT NULL,&#10;  feature_value  text NOT NULL,&#10;  market         text NOT NULL,&#10;  channel        text NOT NULL,&#10;  week           date NOT NULL,&#10;  sample_n       bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  median_lift    numeric(6,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  p25_lift       numeric(6,3),&#10;  p75_lift       numeric(6,3),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (feature_family, feature_value, market, channel, week)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> feature_lift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  feature_family </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  feature_value  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  week</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sample_n       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  median_lift    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p25_lift       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p75_lift       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (feature_family, feature_value, market, channel, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>存储分位数而不只存均值是必要的：一个特征是&quot;整体提升但方差极大&quot;时，其价值远低于&quot;稳定小幅提升&quot;，只看均值会掩盖这个差别。</p>\n<h3 id=\"稳定性门槛\">稳定性门槛</h3><p>一个特征要在下周的生成中被采用，必须通过稳定性检验：连续若干周的中位提升同向且都超过噪声范围。单周的高提升更可能是那一周的偶发事件（比如某个竞品缺货）。这道门槛是把&quot;发现&quot;变成&quot;采用&quot;的关键，它挡掉了大部分伪信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复用推荐的机制\">复用推荐的机制</h2><h3 id=\"生成参数的建议\">生成参数的建议</h3><p>推荐不是把高效素材原样再投一次，而是给出下一轮生成参数的建议。这意味着推荐系统输出的是参数覆盖，而不是素材列表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;suggestionId&quot;: &quot;sg-2026-09-28-014&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: { &quot;market&quot;: &quot;MY&quot;, &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;tiktok&quot;, &quot;locale&quot;: &quot;ms-MY&quot;, &quot;placement&quot;: &quot;9:16&quot; },&#10;  &quot;basedOn&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;evidenceTier&quot;: &quot;experimental&quot;,&#10;    &quot;sampleAssets&quot;: 24,&#10;    &quot;windowWeeks&quot;: 6,&#10;    &quot;stableFeatures&quot;: [&#10;      &quot;layout:left-text-right-image&quot;,&#10;      &quot;copyhook:question&quot;,&#10;      &quot;tone:warm&quot;,&#10;      &quot;sellingpoint:free-shipping+limited-time&quot;&#10;    ]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;paramOverrides&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;layoutTemplateId&quot;: &quot;tpl-left-text-v3&quot;,&#10;    &quot;paletteFamily&quot;: &quot;warm&quot;,&#10;    &quot;copyHook&quot;: &quot;question&quot;,&#10;    &quot;sellingPointCombo&quot;: [&quot;free-shipping&quot;, &quot;limited-time&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;constraints&quot;: { &quot;maxReusePerAsset&quot;: 3, &quot;minVariantDistance&quot;: 0.35 },&#10;  &quot;expiresAt&quot;: &quot;2026-10-26&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"suggestionId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sg-2026-09-28-014\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tiktok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"locale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ms-MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"placement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9:16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"basedOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"evidenceTier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"experimental\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sampleAssets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"windowWeeks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stableFeatures\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"layout:left-text-right-image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"copyhook:question\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"tone:warm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"sellingpoint:free-shipping+limited-time\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"paramOverrides\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"layoutTemplateId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tpl-left-text-v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"paletteFamily\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"copyHook\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"question\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sellingPointCombo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"free-shipping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"limited-time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"constraints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxReusePerAsset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minVariantDistance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expiresAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-26\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段值得解释。<code>evidenceTier</code> 决定这条建议能否自动应用——只有实验级证据才允许自动注入，观测级必须人工确认（与 <a href=\"creative-performance-attribution\">素材效果与转化归因</a> 的写回规则一致）。<code>expiresAt</code> 让建议自动过时，避免长期使用一份老结论。<code>minVariantDistance</code> 是对抗同质化的核心参数，下节展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对抗赢家恒赢\">对抗赢家恒赢</h3><p>如果系统持续推荐同一批特征组合，产出的素材会越来越像，用户的边际注意力会下降，渠道侧的频次控制也会削减投放。三种机制可以维持多样性：</p>\n<p><strong>探索配额。</strong> 每批生成中固定比例（常见 10%–20%）不遵循推荐参数，而是均匀采样特征空间或使用上一轮未采用的建议。这是多臂老虎机里的标准做法——没有持续探索，策略会锁死在局部最优。</p>\n<p><strong>变体距离下限。</strong> 生成时约束新素材与已有素材的差异度不低于阈值。差异度可以用特征向量（版式、色调、句式、卖点组合的 one-hot 拼接）的余弦距离度量。这条约束直接进 <a href=\"../aigc-creative-production/ai-copy-image-video-gen\">AI 文案/图/视频批量生成</a> 的展开器，在任务生成阶段就拒绝过于相近的候选。</p>\n<p><strong>特征预算。</strong> 限制同一特征组合在活跃素材中的占比上限（如不超过 30%）。这比全局距离约束更简单，也更容易向业务方解释。</p>\n<h3 id=\"素材级复用的约束\">素材级复用的约束</h3><p>直接复用某个具体版本时，需要额外检查三件事：授权是否仍覆盖目标市场（见 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/asset-version-rights-license\">版本/版权/授权有效期管理</a>）、该版本是否已被新版本取代（复用已取代版本可能带来已修复的问题）、以及该素材在目标市场的历史投放频次是否已经过高。第三条常被忽略——一个在 A 市场表现极好的素材，在 B 市场可能因为受众重叠已经造成了用户疲劳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈闭环的度量\">反馈闭环的度量</h2><p>推荐系统本身也需要被度量，否则它可能长期给出无效建议而无人察觉。三个指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>健康区间</th>\n<th>异常含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建议采纳率</td>\n<td>被实际用于生成的建议占比</td>\n<td>30%–70%</td>\n<td>过低说明建议不可用；过高说明约束过强、缺少探索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采纳后提升</td>\n<td>采纳建议的素材相对基线的提升</td>\n<td>&gt; 1.0</td>\n<td>长期低于 1 说明特征提取无效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征组合熵</td>\n<td>活跃素材的特征分布熵</td>\n<td>稳定或缓升</td>\n<td>持续下降即同质化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二个指标要按 <code>evidenceTier</code> 分层看——实验级建议的提升应当显著高于观测级，如果两者接近，说明随机化没带来额外价值，实验成本可以削减。这个检验本身就是对归因链条的验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"避免自我实现的循环\">避免自我实现的循环</h3><p>有一个微妙的陷阱：如果推荐系统只推荐已验证特征，而这些特征之所以被验证是因为它们被推荐过（获得了更多曝光从而积累了更多数据），那系统测量的其实是自己的偏好而不是用户的偏好。打破这个循环的唯一办法是让探索配额真正随机，且探索样本同样进入特征效果的计算——如果探索样本被排除在分析之外，循环照旧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>复用推荐分素材级与特征级，特征级才能持续产出新素材；素材级复用边际收益递减。</li>\n<li>特征必须可枚举、可复现、可注入生成参数，否则只是描述不是信号。</li>\n<li>显著性用素材自身的置信区间与同桶分布比较，自动处理数据量差异。</li>\n<li>特征效果要跨素材聚合，存储分位数而不只存均值。</li>\n<li>特征被采用需通过连续多周的稳定性门槛，单周高提升多为偶发。</li>\n<li>推荐输出参数覆盖而非素材列表；<code>evidenceTier</code> 决定能否自动应用，<code>expiresAt</code> 让建议自动过时。</li>\n<li>对抗同质化三机制：探索配额、变体距离下限、特征预算。</li>\n<li>素材级复用需额外检查授权覆盖、版本是否被取代、目标市场历史频次。</li>\n<li>推荐系统自身要以采纳率、采纳后提升、特征组合熵度量；探索样本必须进入分析，否则会形成自我实现的循环。</li>\n<li>上游指标定义见 <a href=\"creative-performance-attribution\">素材效果与转化归因</a>；成本侧的判断见 <a href=\"creative-cost-scale-metric\">创意生产成本与规模化指标</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高效素材识别与复用推荐","id":"高效素材识别与复用推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：素材级信号与特征级信号","id":"核心概念-素材级信号与特征级信号"},{"level":3,"text":"可从素材中提取的特征维度","id":"可从素材中提取的特征维度"},{"level":2,"text":"识别：从指标到可复用的结论","id":"识别-从指标到可复用的结论"},{"level":3,"text":"显著性判断","id":"显著性判断"},{"level":3,"text":"特征级的聚合","id":"特征级的聚合"},{"level":3,"text":"稳定性门槛","id":"稳定性门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"复用推荐的机制","id":"复用推荐的机制"},{"level":3,"text":"生成参数的建议","id":"生成参数的建议"},{"level":3,"text":"对抗赢家恒赢","id":"对抗赢家恒赢"},{"level":3,"text":"素材级复用的约束","id":"素材级复用的约束"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈闭环的度量","id":"反馈闭环的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"避免自我实现的循环","id":"避免自我实现的循环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"素材效果与转化归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-performance-loop/creative-performance-attribution"},"next":{"title":"创意生产成本与规模化指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-performance-loop/creative-cost-scale-metric"}}